# This repo is authored on Linux and stored with LF endings.
#
# Without this file a Windows checkout silently rewrites every text file to CRLF, and the next commit
# from that machine reads as a whole-tree rewrite: before 1.4.0 the working tree carried 33 files
# whose only difference from HEAD was carriage returns, turning a 146-line release into a 12,900-line
# diff and flattening git blame across the project.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Belt and braces for the formats git would otherwise have to sniff for itself. A false "text" guess
# on any of these corrupts the file rather than reformatting it.
*.png  binary
*.dll  binary
*.zip  binary
*.blob binary
